      <title>AI无法真正遗忘：被遗忘权在模型参数中失效</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260824/AI%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E9%81%97%E5%BF%98%E8%A2%AB%E9%81%97%E5%BF%98%E6%9D%83%E5%9C%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88/</link>
